---
import Container from "../components/common/Container.astro";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Learn about the ToolKit Hub project and its static-first architecture."
  path="/about"
>
  <main class="flex-1">
    <Container class="py-12 md:py-16">
      <article class="content-page">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase text-brand-teal">About</p>
        <h1>ToolKit Hub is a growing collection of fast online tools.</h1>
        <p>
          The project starts with a static-first foundation, shared data files, reusable layouts,
          and browser-only tools. The goal is to keep pages fast, private, easy to maintain, and
          simple to deploy.
        </p>
        <h2>Project principles</h2>
        <p>
          Tool pages should load quickly, solve one job clearly, avoid unnecessary dependencies,
          and keep user input on the device whenever possible.
        </p>
      </article>
    </Container>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
